        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1899_7073.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edle, Fromme, Ernnveste, unnd weijse, Jnsonnders guenstige
<lb n="2"/>Herren, Liebe, und guete Frueundt, dennselben seijen meine
<lb n="3"/>frueundtliche guetwillige diennst, unnd grueeß Zuevor.
<lb n="4"/>Meines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Arvecht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbevolner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uenderthenig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Willen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fehniger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wegenhußen</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear> mich, wie daß
<lb n="6"/>Jhme von seiner frueundtlichen lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baßen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Elsbetha</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beucherkheinin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweße</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">buergerin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear>,
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuegefallen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seije</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uechdem</unclear> er Aber daß
<lb n="9"/>beZiehen wellen, so sige Jhme uffterlegt worden,
<lb n="10"/>daß er Fuero ein schriben von mir (alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuere</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesezten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberigkheidt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffweißen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thueege</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hat</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>er mich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ganz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthenigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flißs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhme</unclear> mit disem
<lb n="13"/>gegenwertigen schriben, an dieselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behuelfflich</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuesin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergeneiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuehaben</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wenn</unclear> dann Jch Jhme daß nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verweigern</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khueendten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">JedeerZeit</unclear> geneigt alle die
<lb n="17"/>meinige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anbevohlne</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menigclichen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuebefuerderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollfarthen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Derwegen</unclear> so gelangt an die Herren
<lb n="20"/>samptlichen, mein Frueundtliches biten, unnd ersuechen,
<lb n="21"/>Sij geruechen so frueundt: und guetwillig, unnd
<lb n="22"/>gesagtem Fehniger, sambt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mithaafften</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zue</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allem</unclear> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baßen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eals</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waren</unclear> rechten Erb einem dem recht
<lb n="25"/>unnd billicheit wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuestenndig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>-
<lb n="26"/>helffen, unnd Jhne in erkenung Jl. guenst. Fure:
<lb n="27"/>unnd usserthalb dem rechten lassen benuohlen sin,
<lb n="28"/><origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Thurgöuw</origPlace> <origDate when="1614" resp="#ner">1614</origDate>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1899_7074.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>damit er sich deß zuberhuemen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuesambs</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lüthen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorwüerts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruchtbarlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnüeßen</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>möge. Daß sthet mir, neben dem erwuenschenden
<lb n="32"/>loß umb dieselbige in derglichen, und anderen
<lb n="33"/>gelegenheiten, ganz fründtlich zuerwüderen, ec.
<lb n="34"/>unnd sy hiemit, und unß alle goettlicher obhalt
<lb n="35"/>trüwlich enpfehlende, dat. <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-29" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Frawenfeldt</origPlace>
<lb n="36"/><origDate when="1617-06-09" resp="#ner">den. 9. Junij Anno 1617</origDate>
<lb n="37"/>Bat <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Jacob Frey</persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">riter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">altter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>-
<lb n="38"/>"halter, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raths</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-10" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zugg</unclear></placeName>.
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberen</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nideren</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Turgöw</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ec</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1899_7075.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1899_7076.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="41"/>Denen Edlen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erenuesten</unclear>, Frommen, fürsichtigen unnd wÿsen Herren,
<lb n="42"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Bůrgermeisteren unnd Rath der Stadt Sanct
<lb n="43"/>Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Meinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ereng=</unclear>
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear> guoten Fründen.
</p>
